@overheard deck4
// Writer 4, batch 3. Juniors on Deck 4 talking as you pass: the bunks, mornings, the washrooms, the laundry,
// the common room, weekends. Not about work.

== overheard
? pair:bunk time:morning
A: Are you up?
B: No.
A: Breakfast's in ten.
B: ...I'm up.   #funny

? pair:bunk time:night
A: You awake?
B: I am now.
A: Sorry. Night.
B: Night.   #funny

? pair:bunk
A: Is that my jumper?
B: It was on my bunk.
A: Because you put it there.
B: Fair. It's warm, though.   #funny

? pair:bunk
A: Whose turn to sweep?
B: Yours. I did it last week.
A: You said that last week.
B: And I was right last week.   #funny

? pair:bunk act:off
A: Rest day. What's the plan?
B: Nothing. All of it.
A: Can I join in?
B: There's room for two on nothing.   #warm

? pair:bunk time:evening
A: Did you leave the light on again?
B: It's a reading light. I was reading.
A: You were asleep.
B: I was reading with my eyes shut.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:port_washroom|starboard_washroom
A: Was that you singing?
B: Was it good?
A: It was loud.
B: So, yes.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:port_washroom|starboard_washroom time:night
A: Any hot water left?
B: Ten past ten. What do you think?
A: Character-building, then.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:port_washroom|starboard_washroom time:morning
A: You've got toothpaste on your chin.
B: Where? Here?
A: Other side. There. Gone.

? pair:any+any place:laundry
A: Is this sock yours?
B: Is it odd?
A: It's very odd.
B: Then it's mine.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:laundry
A: How long's left on yours?
B: Twenty minutes.
A: I'll wait. It's warm in here.
B: Best room on the deck, the laundry.   #warm

? pair:any+any place:laundry
A: Did you wash a red thing with the whites?
B: Did I?
A: Everything's pink.
B: Pink's nice. Pink's very nice.   #funny

? pair:friend place:commons
A: Tiles?
B: Only if you don't gloat.
A: I never gloat.
B: You gloated last week. For a week.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:commons
A: Have you seen the comics wall?
B: I'm in it again. With a mop.
A: You were holding a mop.
B: Once!   #funny

? pair:friend place:commons time:evening
A: Budge up.
B: There's a whole sofa.
A: This is the warm end.
B: Fine. Budge up, then.   #warm

? pair:any+any place:commons
A: Who started this jigsaw?
B: Nobody knows. It's been here since Greening.
A: It's all sky.
B: That's why nobody finishes it.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:commons !who:rina !with:rina
A: Anyone fancy taking Rina on at Tiles?
B: I've got a bad back.
A: You're the youngest in the bunk.
B: It's a very young bad back.   #funny

? pair:friend place:commons act:off
A: Tea?
B: Is it your pot or mine?
A: Mine. The good one.
B: Then yes. Thank you.   #warm

? pair:any+any deck:4 act:off weekday:sat
A: Saturday. What are you doing?
B: Laundry. Then lying down.
A: Same. Sofas in the common room?
B: Deal. Bring the big blanket.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 act:off weekday:sun
A: Swap meet?
B: What've you got?
A: A book I've read twice.
B: I'll swap you my one I've read three times.   #funny

? pair:friend deck:4 act:off
A: Garden after breakfast?
B: Pond bench?
A: Pond bench.
B: Lovely. Bring a biscuit.   #warm

? pair:any+any deck:4 time:evening
A: Film tonight?
B: Is it the long one again?
A: It's always the long one.
B: Bring two cushions, then.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 time:night
A: Shh. Bunk eight's asleep.
B: It's ten at night.
A: It's their night. It's their morning. It's confusing.
B: Shh, then.   #funny

? pair:friend deck:4
A: Did you get a letter?
B: Two. From my aunt. Both about her hens.
A: How are the hens?
B: Laying well, apparently.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4
A: Somebody left a tiny portrait on my pillow.
B: Of who?
A: Of me. Sleeping.
B: That's... nice? That's nice.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 season:lanterns
A: Is that your lantern?
B: It's meant to be a star.
A: It's very lantern-shaped.
B: It's a lantern-shaped star.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 season:sowing
A: How's your seedling?
B: Two leaves.
A: Mine's got three.
B: It's not a race. ...Three, though?   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 time:morning
A: Did you sleep?
B: Like a log.
A: You snore like one too.
B: Logs don't snore.   #funny

? pair:any+any deck:4 trad:quiz
A: Quiz tonight. Are we a team?
B: We came last last time.
A: So we can only go up.
B: That's the spirit.   #funny

? pair:friend deck:4 time:evening
A: Homesick today. Bit.
B: Tea and Tiles?
A: Tea and Tiles.
B: Come on, then.   #warm

? pair:bunk time:night
A: Who's got the torch?
B: What for?
A: My book. It's the good bit.
B: Read it in the morning. Night.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:musicroom
A: Is it your turn with the guitar book?
B: It's always my turn.
A: It's never your turn.
B: Then whose turn is it?   #funny

? pair:friend deck:4 act:off
A: Letter from home?
B: From my brother. Mostly drawings.
A: Of what?
B: Of me. As a spaceship.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:commons time:evening
A: Whose turn to flip the record?
B: Not mine. I did side one.
A: Fine. I'll get up, then.   #funny

? pair:bunk time:morning
A: It's raining.
B: It's the vents.
A: Let me have this.
B: Fine. It's raining.   #warm

? pair:any+any deck:4 time:evening
A: Cocoa?
B: Have you got a tin?
A: I've got half a tin.
B: Half a tin's a party.   #funny
